# Delegation

¶ - Adaptive execution units, exclusive write ownership and evidence returns.

document:
  id: task.delegation@2
  version: 2
  status: proposed
  authority_basis: [@task/global-policy]
  scope: briefing, units, concurrency, return_handling
  excludes: lifecycle, test_protocol

¶ 1 — Briefing Contract

briefing:
  language: TDSL
  required: [unit_ref task_refs governing_refs target_refs write_scope validation_criteria constraints]
  root: explicit_absolute_project_root
  key_files: path_and_one_line_role
  minimal_context: index_refs_then_required_source_ranges
  target_tokens: 400
  ownership: exclusive_paths_including_reports_and_temporaries
  constraints: others_work_here_do_not_revert_their_changes
  template: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/templates/briefing.template
rule: missing_required_field -> refine_before_spawn
rule: depth_lives_in_referenced_sources_not_repeated_briefing

¶ 2 — Units and Concurrency

unit:
  identity: @unit/<id>
  members: feature_or_dependency_valid_task_group_or_task
  selection: difficulty_dependencies_context_and_destinations
  difficulty: [low medium high]
  low: may_batch
  medium: batch_when_dependencies_and_context_allow
  high: prefer_dedicated_executor
concurrency:
  max_active_subagents: 1
  parallel_requires: independent_units_disjoint_write_scopes
  shared_outputs: one_designated_writer
  accounting: active_agents_not_total_created_agents
rule: executor_replaced_after_delivery; failed_attempt_may_reuse_same_executor
rule: no_overwriting_another_agents_source_journal_report_or_temporary

¶ 3 — Escalation and Return

return:
  language: TDSL
  required: [unit_ref files_changed outcome evidence_refs deviations blockers]
  material_decision: record_when_taken
  material_failure: record_with_resolution_or_open_state
  success_claim: orchestrator_verifies_declared_criteria
  contested_test: return_reason_do_not_edit_or_delete_test
  precise_failures: same_executor_when_available
escalation:
  known_answer: solve_within_authority
  insufficient_context: targeted_research_then_retry
  outside_authority_or_real_unknown: orchestrator_reports_to_operator
  executor: never_escalates_directly_to_operator
  test_gate: orchestrator_only

¶ 4 — Context Sufficiency and Operational Continuity

contracts:
  context: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/behavior/loops/L02.tdsl
  execution: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/behavior/loops/L04.tdsl
  delivery: {{KERNEL_HOME}}/behavior/loops/L08.tdsl
rule: evaluate_sufficiency_before_each_additional_context_acquisition
rule: reuse_loaded_context_and_confirm_only_needed_mutable_facts
rule: cold_entry_recovers_missing_instructions_project_feature_authority_and_relevant_history
rule: warm_cold_is_contextual_not_persisted_configuration
rule: preserve_runtime_eligibility_ownership_authority_and_interruption_contracts
rule: validated_owned_code_requires_commit_check_before_final_delivery
rule: existing_authorization_for_work_and_commit_needs_no_repeated_confirmation
rule: blocked_commit_is_reported_as_uncommitted_not_as_completed_delivery
rule: hooks_do_not_judge_semantic_sufficiency_or_commit_code
